11. One-page Handoff Summary
• CI: local YAML calls EPI-owned shared templates. Contact EPI for shared CI/template issues.
• CD: local template resolves an image tag, transfers the image from Lucius/JFrog to GAR, deploys Cloud Run candidate revisions, verifies readiness, and promotes traffic where configured.
• Existing-image path: set `runBuild=false` and provide `imageVersion`. Missing version is a configuration error.
• Secrets: keep GCP JSON keys and Lucius auth in Azure DevOps Library > Secure files; use `DownloadSecureFile@1`.
• Approvals: configure in Azure DevOps Environments > Approvals and checks for protected UAT/PROD deployments.
• Vulnerabilities: review JFrog Xray. Fix vulnerable dependencies/base images; escalate shared-pipeline issues to EPI.
